prompt:
This repo already has src/store.ts (an in-memory post store), src/lib/text.ts and src/tags.ts. Add a createPost({title, body, tags}) function in src/posts.ts that:
- generates a URL slug from the title, unique among existing posts (append -2, -3, ... on collision);
- builds an excerpt from the body: markdown stripped, at most 140 characters, cut at a word boundary with an ellipsis;
- normalizes the tags (lowercase slugs, deduplicated);
- rejects an empty title or an empty body with a descriptive error;
- inserts the post into the store and returns it.
Also add getPostBySlug(slug).
